==English==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|hwc}} [[w:craps|craps]] slang, meaning “to wager everything on one roll”.

Popularized by [[w:442nd Infantry Regiment (United States)#Unit fight song|442nd Infantry Regiment’s fight song]], 1939–1945.

===Verb===
'''[[go]] for [[broke]]'''
#To [[wager]] everything.
#{{idiom}} To try everything possible or do last thing possible in a final attempt.

